===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|bar|gmh|haven}}, from {{inh|bar|goh|havan}}, {{m|goh|hafan}}. Probably related to {{m|bar|hebn}}, ultimately from {{inh|bar|gmw-pro|*habbjan}}. Compare also {{cog|de|Häfen}} and {{m|de|Hafner}}.

