{{unc|bar}}. Either the same as etymology 1 or from {{inh|bar|gmh|habene}}, {{m|gmh|habe}} (in which case cognate with {{cog|de|Hafen}}, {{cog|nl|haven}}, and {{cog|en|haven}}) or a conflation of both.

